{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1-1-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/6-1-743x1024.jpeg\">\n<p>裝甲車入銅鑼灣 警截查穿黑衣市民</p>\n<p>下午時分，銅鑼灣一帶隨處可見軍裝或便衣警員巡邏，有裝甲車停泊在時代廣場連卡佛門口，有自由行旅客途經用手機影相留念，在軒尼詩道亦駐守了兩部衝鋒車。</p>\n<p>銅鑼灣地鐵站內、近崇光百貨、維園出口駐守了多名 PTU 警員，截查身穿黑衣的市民。記者亦被截查及要求查看隨身物品，之後放行。駱克道停泊了共七輛豬籠車、衝鋒車、戰術巴士，亦有十名配備戰術背心的警員巡邏。</p>\n<p>維園變家鄉市集 噴水池今被鐵馬圍封</p>\n<p>維園噴水池今被鐵馬圍封，告士打道及興發街入口均各有十多名警員駐守，另有兩人一組警員，不時在通道巡邏。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7-1-1024x692.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_0499-1024x619.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_0506-1024x705.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DSC00295-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DSC00186-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DSC00215-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-04T07:39:01.578554+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":259,"images":9,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}